The petitioner is directed to be enlarged on bail in Crime No.71/2024 registered by Srirangapatna Rural Police Station, Mandya, for the offences punishable under Sections 498A, 504, 506, 307 and 326 of IPC, subject to the following conditions:
a) Petitioner shall execute a personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/- with two sureties for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;
c) The petitioner shall not directly or indirectly threaten or tamper with the prosecution witnesses;
d) The petitioner shall not involve in similar offences in future;
NC: 2024:KHC:45080 e) The petitioner shall not leave the jurisdiction of the Trial Court without permission of the said Court until the case registered against him is disposed off.
SD/-
(S VISHWAJITH SHETTY) JUDGE DN Prasanna vs The State Of Karnataka on 7 November, 2024 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/79655124/
